'' A '#cmdline' naming an option only the command line may set is refused, by name, and
'' the build stops: '--diagnostics-file' would have the compiler write where the source says.
'' See SourceOptionOk_ in src/driver/cmdline.tiko.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --parse-only tests/driver/src/cmdline-refused.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0178: '--diagnostics-file' is not allowed in a #cmdline: only the command line may set it
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: build/.cmdline-refused.tsv
